  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you add SendRPC action to VRC_AudioBank from \"Events from Scene\" menu item (for example Play), you'll see its target value is \"Others\" in advanced mode.\nThen, other players hear the sound but a player triggering the action doesn't. I think this is inappropriate behavior as initial setting and \"All\" is \nuseful.\n\nEnvironment: VRCSDK-2018.02.28.21.21\nWorkaround: After adding SendRPC, check advanced mode on, and change target value to All (or other value you want)",
